{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026F2aFtvSXY31795580178.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報阿里巴巴正討論明年發行離岸債券融資。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》引述消息指，公司已與投行進行初步洽談，評估以離岸人民幣和美元發債的計劃，不過討論仍處於初步階段，細節可能仍有變數。而公司最終決定發債時機前，將評估市場波動等多項因素。阿里巴巴暫時沒評論消息。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T05:23:54.475279+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T04:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T06:55:41.740477+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T05:17:16.495467+00:00","content_hash":"121e96a02ddd10c805f74cd27282bbf3a8f0bc79f177521898a2cb133fdb4617","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T05:23:54.475279+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}